meta {
  name: 5 custom baseline hold
  seq: 5
}

docs {
  Organizer raises the event's baseline authorization hold to EUR 50.00 (5000
  cents), then runs a full tab through to capture so it can be inspected in
  Stripe:

  1. organizer logs in and patches baselineHoldCents to 5000
  2. operator logs into the stand
  3. attendee opens a tab — the 5000 hold is verified in our response and
     against the real Stripe PaymentIntent amount
  4. attendee orders one item within the hold; operator marks it ready
  5. organizer checkout captures the ready item against the real Stripe test API
     => a captured PaymentIntent shows up in the Stripe dashboard

  The final request resets the hold back to the EUR 10.00 (1000 cents) default so
  the shared Dev event is left as the other folders expect it.
}
